  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8cfc9115-fa6e-418d-9885-ee3556e45b2c.png\" alt=\"galosphere\" width=\"850\" height=\"438\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2014cae8-e980-448a-ae26-71aa1dbe2c1c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_60d8a93e-e582-44bd-a3ce-d1fd4060d699.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgalosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_66523eaa-30a9-4917-91fe-6b285214aa0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fOrcinusWasTaken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_d02d553b-ab4f-492f-bc41-d94c2699505d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_45b4c79a-5c20-4617-86a0-451eeb134516.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📘：总体概述</strong></span></p>\n<p>Galosphere 是一款旨在通过添加新内容（如新生物群系、机制、生物等）来改善地下体验的模组。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📝：注意事项</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模组支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 平台。Galosphere 是一款旨在通过添加新内容（如新生物群系、机制、生物等）来改善地下体验的模组。</p>\n<p>如果您对本模组有任何建议，欢迎加入我的 Discord 服务器了解更多。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🧰：整合包作者</strong></span></p>\n<p>您可以将此模组放入您的整合包中，但请务必注明出处或致谢！</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>💎：部分特性</strong></span></p>\n<p>水晶峡谷</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_eb0b2eef-05a0-4186-ac0c-2e00fad7631d.png\" alt=\"crystal_canyons\" width=\"850\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p><strong><em>水晶峡谷</em></strong>&nbsp;包含两种新宝石——<strong>allurite 与 lumiere</strong>，它们会在该生物群系中形成巨大的晶体结构。探索时，您还可以找到&nbsp;<strong>sparkles</strong>，它们能在背上生长 allurite 和 lumiere！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_c07a97ae-936a-4ce3-8749-f071bc888889.png\" alt=\"p_crystal_canyons\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>地衣洞穴</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8e32f1c5-d999-44d2-ba60-4ca5729b61df.png\" alt=\"lichen_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><strong>地衣洞穴</strong> 中长满了 <strong>地衣苔藓</strong> 和巨型蘑菇。您可以在整个生物群系中看到小 <strong>spectres</strong> 和平地飞翔与游荡。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_13a3ba2e-03fe-424e-a308-a0a6b91bf45f.png\" alt=\"p_lichen_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>粉盐洞穴</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_2e0906c1-4c79-4b51-9030-1b3a26e153a6.png\" alt=\"pink_salt_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p><strong>粉盐洞穴</strong> 覆盖着粉色、玫瑰色和淡粉色的盐。在探索这个独特的生物群系时，您可能会偶然发现一些神秘的 <strong>古代神殿</strong>……</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8bb0f6b5-06bc-4958-b155-58d1fc23199e.png\" alt=\"p_pink_salt_caves\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>遗忘遗迹</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_f2275f3a-0c3e-4a59-86e1-831ad7a8a77b.png\" alt=\"forgotten_ruins\" width=\"850\" height=\"326\"></p>\n<p><strong>遗忘遗迹</strong> 是一种罕见的 <strong>地下结构</strong>，内部充满了可供您清理的 <strong>可疑方块</strong>。您甚至还能遇到一些 <strong>鼹鼠</strong>，它们会为您提供一些旅途中的小 <strong>支线任务</strong>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_59b1d7d4-8ec5-4262-8aba-98fdf2a1df45.png\" alt=\"p_forgotten_ruins_1\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/631098/description_8429e5a0-1ca8-4bc1-ab3b-27384386ccd9.png\" alt=\"p_forgotten_ruins_2\" width=\"850\" height=\"325\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">📺：<strong>模组预览</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:614px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vxodY0zYmZE\" width=\"607\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ajl3DW2PjGo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RRmG0DUYOYI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/en8u3KcWUPU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xpVSGRDQLcc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h3>\n</div>\n<p><img></p>",
